From 582023e8f264d418b28b75d78202a56355d5ece5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jasper Korten <jja2000@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Feb 2024 22:36:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 024/136] FROMLIST v1 arm64: dts: qcom: Add Samsung Galaxy
 Book2 Go

The Samsung Galaxy Book2 Go is a laptop with a Snapdragon 7c+ Gen 3 SoC
(SC7280).

Add initial functionality:
* Display (with backlight, GPU)
* Touchpad & keyboard (without Fn key mapping support)
* UFS storage
* SD card
* USB Type-A port
* Modem and mobile data
* WiFi & Bluetooth
* ADSP & CDSP bootup
* Battery fuel gauge
* Venus/Iris
* Lid switch
* RGB LED (Operating status LED)
* Webcam (USB UVC)

Notably missing:
* Speaker & microphone
* Charging
* USB Type-C ports (except when active at boot)
* DisplayPort on right-side USB-C port

Signed-off-by: Jasper Korten <jja2000@gmail.com>
Co-developed-by: Federico Amedeo Izzo <federico@izzo.pro>
Signed-off-by: Federico Amedeo Izzo <federico@izzo.pro>
